{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":96152,"duration_api_ms":121233,"num_turns":14,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0ad529eb-ceae-4111-80fa-bda6801a1486","total_cost_usd":0.6749118500000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"cache_creation_input_tokens":47674,"cache_read_input_tokens":403197,"output_tokens":3518,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":47674,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":34,"outputTokens":3558,"cacheReadInputTokens":106131,"cacheCreationInputTokens":47127,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.08734585,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":11,"outputTokens":3518,"cacheReadInputTokens":403197,"cacheCreationInputTokens":47674,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5875659999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["All 162+ tests pass across tank_core (23+5+13+22+21+12+10+12+1+5+17+6+1+1+8 = 157 unit/integration tests), tank_data (6 tests), and tank_scenarios (2 tests) with 0 failures.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core -p tank_data -p tank_scenarios --all-targets -- -D warnings` produces zero warnings.","`cargo fmt --all --check` produces no output — formatting is clean.","Old pH shortcut (`6.3 + log10(alk) - log10(DIC)`) is completely absent from the codebase; grep confirms no matches in any Rust file.","Solver is a closed-form O(1) quadratic in [H+] (chemistry.rs:338-385) using temperature-corrected pKa1 via Harned & Davis (1943) at chemistry.rs:54-57. Deterministic with no iteration.","TankSnapshot exposes `ph` (line 29), `co2_aq_mmol_per_l` (line 22), and `dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_l` (line 21) — all derived from a single fresh `solve_carbonate_equilibrium` call in `from_state` (snapshot.rs:76-81). Unit test `snapshot_uses_one_carbonate_solution_for_ph_and_co2` locks in self-consistency.","Amendment fr-6-ac16acee implemented: `bicarbonate_mg_total` initialized to `0.0` with `// solver-derived; set by resolve_carbonate_state below` in both `default_for_volume_l` (water.rs:59) and `from_source_profile_for_volume_l` (water.rs:105), followed by `resolve_carbonate_state` calls at lines 64 and 110 respectively.","Amendment fr-6-c7d4a16a implemented: nitrogen_cycle.rs lines 364-367 now contain expanded comment: 'The subsequent chemistry step is responsible for re-running the carbonate solver after this alkalinity mutation. Until then, `water.ph` and `bicarbonate_mg_total` remain stale cached projections, so any new system inserted between nitrification and chemistry must not read them.'","`total_tracked_ions_mg()` (water.rs:210-214) has doc comment documenting the resolve precondition for `bicarbonate_mg_total`.","`rescale_totals_for_volume` (water.rs:184-207) excludes `bicarbonate_mg_total` from scaling and calls `resolve_carbonate_state` at line 207.","`normalize_loaded_carbonate_state()` (save.rs:387-396) unconditionally re-solves from canonical DIC/alkalinity/temperature on every load. `reconcile_stability_tracker()` (save.rs:398-413) prevents false instability spikes from the repair.","V2->V3 migration excludes `bicarbonate_mg_total` from dissolved-field rescaling with explicit comment (save.rs:286-289). V3->V4 migration is a deliberate no-op relying on serde defaults (save.rs:333-374).","Source-water validation unified: both `SourceWaterPreset::validate()` and `SourceWaterProfile::validate()` route through `validate_source_water_carbonate_profile()` (chemistry.rs:441-468) using the same solver.","`SourceWaterProfile::bicarbonate_mg_per_l` (source_water.rs:25-28) documented as display-only.","All three solver fallback paths (acid_dominated, high_buffer, outside_quadratic_envelope) reproject species via `carbonate_species_for_ph()` and emit structured `tracing::debug!` diagnostics.","Clamp-boundary trade-off documented at chemistry.rs:387-390: DIC conservation vs alkalinity consistency.","Working tree is clean — only unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory remains."],"findings_or_gaps":["Ka2 is fixed at 10.33 without temperature correction. Documented as acceptable for freshwater pH 5.5-8.5 where CO3-- is a minor fraction, but should be revisited if the solver is extended to marine or high-pH regimes.","The `fallback_zero_dic` path does not emit a tracing diagnostic when both DIC and alkalinity are negligible (returning NEUTRAL_FALLBACK directly). Defensible since deionized-water equilibrium is not operationally interesting, but it is a minor gap relative to the blanket fallback diagnostic pattern. Severity: cosmetic.","Legacy saves with custom out-of-range source-water catalog entries still deserialize but water-change actions against those profiles now fail at runtime with InvalidSourceProfile. Correct behavior but could surprise users with very old custom profiles.","WaterState struct fields lack per-field doc comments distinguishing canonical inputs from derived caches; the distinction is enforced through code behavior (resolve calls, rescale exclusions) and method-level/inline comments. Field-level annotations would improve discoverability for future contributors."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"6c041b94-6845-41dc-b843-5f42019da489"}
